<title>UK: Walt Disney sets NZ$100 mln three-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Walt Disney sets NZ$100 mln three-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WALT DISNEY CO</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.25 PCT  MATURITY    26.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.275   PAY DATE    26.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50 PCT  REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50 PCT  SELL CONC  1.0 PCT   PRAECIP     0.125 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
